SANDBOX

This folder holds test files, demos, and small experiments for trying
this repository's project out by hand. It is for playing with the
program, separate from automated tests (tests/) and developer helpers
(tools/).


WHAT GOES HERE

  Sample input files, interactive demo scripts, and throwaway configs
  that let someone exercise the program and see how it behaves. Nothing
  here is installed by make install, and make test does not rely on it.


IN THIS REPOSITORY

  Interactive demos and throwaway configs for playing with tam-last by
  hand without touching ~/.config/tam-last/tam-last.ini. Run any demo
  directly from the repository root (it launches build/tam-last), or
  start with the menu:

    ./sandbox/play             interactive menu of all demos
    ./sandbox/demo-looks       0.0.5: bold/italic, box drawing, blocks,
                               Braille wave, and fallback symbols
    ./sandbox/demo-colors      16-color, 256-color, and 24-bit gradients
    ./sandbox/demo-scrollback  0.0.4: 250 lines for wheel, Shift+PgUp,
                               selection, clipboard, and bracketed paste
    ./sandbox/demo-mouse       0.0.4: interactive SGR mouse paint canvas
                               (wheel changes color, Shift bypasses)
    ./sandbox/demo-fullscreen  0.0.3: alt screen, scroll region, cursor
                               styles, DEC line-drawing, combining marks
    ./sandbox/demo-config      0.0.5: launches tam-last with the
                               throwaway sandbox/theme-gruvbox.ini
    ./sandbox/demo-kitty       0.1.0: interactive kitty keyboard protocol
                               viewer (toggle flags 1..16 with F1..F5)
    ./sandbox/demo-keys        0.1.1: launches tam-last --keys with a raw
                               receiver to compare trace vs pty bytes
    ./sandbox/demo-layouts     0.1.2: launches tam-last --keys --layout us-intl
                               (or another layout) for AltGr, dead keys & Compose
    ./sandbox/demo-ime         0.1.3: launches tam-last --keys with a raw UTF-8
                               receiver for text-input-v3 input methods
    ./sandbox/demo-osc         0.2.0: window titles, OSC 7/8/52 policy, and
                               OSC 4/10/11/12/104 color queries and live swaps
    ./sandbox/demo-queries     0.2.1: DA2, XTVERSION, DECRQM, DEC 2026
                               synchronized output, and tam-last terminfo
    sandbox/theme-gruvbox.ini  sample tam_ini config (Gruvbox, 11 pt)

  Pass --in-term to any demo script to run it in the current terminal
  instead of spawning a new build/tam-last window.
